    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"45878269\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# Live session run\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"End-to-end CNMFe run on a real recording sitting on the server. Edit\\n\",\n",
    "    \"`SESSION_RAW` and the `SSUB` / `TSUB` downsample factors, then step through.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Path layout** (mirrors the standard `0_raw / 1_preprocessed / 2_processed`\\n\",\n",
    "    \"project tree):\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `0_raw/<session>/miniscope_video/*.avi`                  — source AVIs (read-only)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `1_preprocessed/<session>/miniscope_video/mc.zarr`       — motion-corrected zarr (the ONLY zarr written)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `1_preprocessed/<session>/miniscope_video/shifts.npy`    — per-frame (dy, dx)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `2_processed/<session>/miniscope_video/mc_plots/`        — diagnostic plots\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `2_processed/<session>/miniscope_video/mc_downsampled.mp4` — every Nth frame, visual QC\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `2_processed/<session>/miniscope_video/results/`         — CNMFe output (A, C, S, YrA, ...)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Fused, single write — decode + (optional) downsample + motion-correct in one\\n\",\n",
    "    \"pass.** `CNMFe.fit_mc_from_avis(..., ssub=SSUB, tsub=TSUB)` decodes the AVIs,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"block-mean bins them inline when `SSUB`/`TSUB` > 1, and applies rigid motion\\n\",\n",
    "    \"correction — writing only `mc.zarr` (no intermediate `session.zarr` / `ds.zarr`).\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Spatial binning averages `SSUB×SSUB` pixel blocks; temporal binning averages\\n\",\n",
    "    \"`TSUB` consecutive frames per file. Everything after runs on that movie;\\n\",\n",
    "    \"parameters are rescaled to its grid via `CNMFeParams.downscaled(SSUB, TSUB)`.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Outputs stay at the downsampled resolution.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Temporal binning happens **before** MC by design (fine for slow drift / small\\n\",\n",
    "    \"`TSUB`; see CLAUDE.md). **Extraction uses the staged API:** `fit_extract(...)`\\n\",\n",
    "    \"then `evaluate()` (equivalent to one `CNMFe.fit(..., do_motion_correction=False)`).\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Each step is **idempotent**: if its output exists, the cell reuses it. Delete\\n\",\n",
    "    \"the file/folder on disk to redo a step.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
