    "   \"execution_count\": 12\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"a2cb89ed\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"## 7b. Per-pixel temporal detrend (optional preprocessing)\\n\\nWhen the extracted traces (section 9) show **all components firing in\\nlockstep** — saturated `S` spike trains spanning the same frame ranges across\\nevery component — that is the signature of a per-pixel baseline drift (LED\\nwarm-up, focus / exposure step, slow photobleach) that OASIS cannot explain\\nunder the AR(1) decay enforced by the `decay_time_ms` prior. It fires a spike\\nevery frame to track the slow drift.\\n\\n`detrend_movie` subtracts a per-pixel rolling lower-percentile baseline along\\ntime (window = `DETREND_WINDOW_S * frame_rate_hz` frames). The lower percentile\\nis robust to bright transients (the window is dominated by inter-event\\nbaseline), so real calcium spikes survive but slow drifts get flattened.\\nOutput is written to `mc_detrended.zarr` next to `mc.zarr` and becomes the\\ninput to section 8 when enabled. Idempotent — delete the zarr to re-run.\\n\\n**Trade-off:** the detrend also removes any genuinely population-wide slow\\nsignal. Leave `DETREND_WINDOW_S = None` to skip the step entirely when traces\\nlook clean.\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {}\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"ebee8278\",\n",
    "   \"source\": \"# --- EDIT ME -----------------------------------------------------------------\\nDETREND_WINDOW_S   = 30.0    # set to e.g. 30.0 to enable; None = skip detrend\\nDETREND_PERCENTILE = 10.0    # lower-percentile baseline (robust to spikes)\\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n\\nMC_DETRENDED_ZARR = SESSION_PREPROC / 'mc_detrended.zarr'\\n\\nif DETREND_WINDOW_S is None:\\n    print('detrend: SKIPPED (set DETREND_WINDOW_S to enable)')\\n    extract_zarr      = clean_zarr\\n    extract_zarr_path = clean_zarr_path\\nelse:\\n    from minicnmfe.detrend import detrend_movie\\n    t0 = time.time()\\n    extract_zarr = detrend_movie(\\n        clean_zarr_path, MC_DETRENDED_ZARR,\\n        window_s=DETREND_WINDOW_S,\\n        percentile=DETREND_PERCENTILE,\\n        frame_rate_hz=params_eff.frame_rate_hz,\\n        batch_t=params_eff.mc_batch_size,\\n        n_jobs=params_eff.n_jobs,\\n        skip_if_exists=True,\\n    )\\n    print(f'detrend wall time: {time.time() - t0:.1f}s')\\n    extract_zarr_path = MC_DETRENDED_ZARR\\n\\nprint(f'extract input -> {extract_zarr_path}  shape={extract_zarr.shape}')\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-05-27T13:45:41.659201096Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-05-27T13:45:41.611835633Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "     \"name\": \"stdout\",\n",
    "     \"output_type\": \"stream\",\n",
    "     \"text\": [\n",
    "      \"Skipping detrend; /media/server/archive/projects/2023_intercontext/ToneComparison/data/1_preprocessed/20260520_m0000163_som_1317/miniscope_video/mc_detrended.zarr already exists.\\n\",\n",
    "      \"detrend wall time: 0.0s\\n\",\n",
    "      \"extract input -> /media/server/archive/projects/2023_intercontext/ToneComparison/data/1_preprocessed/20260520_m0000163_som_1317/miniscope_video/mc_detrended.zarr  shape=(40390, 300, 300)\\n\"\n",
    "     ]\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 13\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
