    "   \"id\": \"0cc34a09\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## 8. CNMFe extraction (staged: `fit_extract` + `evaluate`)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Runs extraction on `mc.zarr` (already at the downsampled resolution) using the\\n\",\n",
    "    \"rescaled `params_eff`. The movie is materialised in RAM here; for very long\\n\",\n",
    "    \"recordings switch to the streaming path in\\n\",\n",
    "    \"`demo_notebooks/02_extract_components.ipynb` (Section 9).\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"`fit_extract(movie, evaluate=False)` runs greedy init → ring background →\\n\",\n",
    "    \"spatial/temporal/merge BCD → final temporal pass + YrA; `model.evaluate()` then\\n\",\n",
    "    \"tags components non-destructively (`accepted_mask`). A single\\n\",\n",
    "    \"`CNMFe.fit(movie, do_motion_correction=False)` does both in one call.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"If the results folder already contains `manifest.json` we reload it instead of\\n\",\n",
    "    \"re-running.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"70665c1e\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-05-27T14:01:13.725710072Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-05-27T13:49:06.112780415Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"if (RESULTS_DIR / 'manifest.json').exists():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'results already present in {RESULTS_DIR}; reloading')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print('(delete manifest.json to re-run)')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    model = CNMFe.load(RESULTS_DIR)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"else:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ram_gb = T_mc * H * W * 4 / 1e9\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'loading {extract_zarr_path.name} into RAM '\\n\",\n",
    "    \"          f'({T_mc} x {H} x {W} float32 ~ {ram_gb:.1f} GB)...')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    t0 = time.time()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    movie = np.asarray(extract_zarr, dtype=np.float32)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f'  loaded in {time.time() - t0:.1f}s')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    # Staged extraction on the (possibly rejected/detrended) corrected movie.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    t0 = time.time()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    model = CNMFe(params_eff)\\n\",\n",
