    "      \"Extraction config: n_jobs=-1 device=cpu T=40390 H=300 W=300 streaming=no (movie materialised in RAM)\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Estimating noise...\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Running greedy CORR-PNR initialization (init_stride=8, T_init=5049; corrpnr_stride=2, T_corrpnr=2524)...\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Using Bayesian g prior: decay_time_ms=180 frame_rate_hz=10.0 -> g_target=0.5738 (weight=0.95)\\n\",\n",
    "      \"  Found 44 initial components.\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Fitting ring-model background (radius=9.0px, tsub=5)...\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Fitting rank-1 global background b_f · f(t) (initial)...\\n\",\n",
