    "    \"  mc_plots/   shifts.png  mean_before_after.png  template_before_after.png\\n\",\n",
    "    \"              footprints_overlay.png  traces.png  native_footprints_traces.png\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  mc_downsampled.mp4          # every Nth frame, normalised\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  results/    A.npz  C.npy  S.npy  YrA.npy  C_raw.npy\\n\",\n",
    "    \"              sn.npy  sn_per_k.npy  g.npy  b0.npy  W.npz\\n\",\n",
    "    \"              accepted_mask.npy  eval_info.npz\\n\",\n",
    "    \"              params.json  manifest.json  run_info.json\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Outputs (footprints + traces) are at the **downsampled** resolution\\n\",\n",
    "    \"(`SSUB`/`TSUB`); the factors are recorded in `run_info.json`. The fused\\n\",\n",
    "    \"`fit_mc_from_avis` decodes, bins, and motion-corrects in one pass, so `mc.zarr`\\n\",\n",
    "    \"is the only movie written — no `session.zarr` or `ds.zarr`. Reload:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```python\\n\",\n",
    "    \"from minicnmfe.pipeline import CNMFe\\n\",\n",
    "    \"model = CNMFe.load('/.../2_processed/<session>/miniscope_video/results')\\n\",\n",
    "    \"A, C, S, YrA = model.A, model.C, model.S, model.YrA\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Re-tag with different thresholds without re-extracting:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"model.params.auto_eval_snr_amp_thr = 5.0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"model.evaluate()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
